# One link beside another app's bulk upload (iperf3, CUBIC) from 5 s to
# 20 s on a 10 Mbit/s uplink that loses 1 % of its packets at random, the
# upload's data and acknowledgements too: 16 KiB every 250 ms, a probe
# every 10 ms.
# env: VIEWERS=1 SEED_UP_MBIT=10 SECS=25 COMPETE=5:15 SEED_LOSS_PCT=1
burst 0 1 0 250 16384 16384
probe 0 1 3 10
